{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 38, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the article, a link is provided. The rules for solving the Sudoku puzzle are outlined, with a key exception being that numbers within cells contained by grey lines must sum up to the values indicated in the corners. This variation adds a new layer of complexity to the traditional Sudoku rules. The puzzle requires careful attention to ensure that no number is repeated within each shape formed by the grey lines. The goal is to fill in the missing numbers according to these rules.\n\n\n \nAddition to the traditional Sudoku rules, the numbers in the cells within grey lines have a specific sum that must be achieved. This means that solvers need to not only ensure that each row, column, and shape contains the numbers 1-9 without repetition but also that the sums of the numbers within the grey-lined cells match the given figures. This added complexity makes the puzzle more challenging and requires a strategic approach. The sums in the corners provide crucial clues for solving the puzzle.\n\n\n \nThe puzzle is presented as a challenge, with the solution available in the next week's Observer Digital Edition. This allows solvers to attempt to complete the puzzle on their own before checking their answers against the provided solution. The puzzle is a fun and engaging way to exercise problem-solving skills and logic. By working through the puzzle, solvers can improve their critical thinking abilities and enjoy the satisfaction of completing a challenging task.\n\n\n \nThe rules outlined for the puzzle are clear and concise, making it easy for new solvers to understand how to approach the challenge. The use of grey lines to indicate the cells that must sum up to specific values adds a visual element to the puzzle, helping solvers to quickly identify the key areas of focus. With patience and persistence, solvers can work through the puzzle and enjoy the sense of accomplishment that comes with completing it.\n\n\n \nOverall, the puzzle offers a unique and engaging challenge that combines traditional Sudoku rules with an additional layer of complexity. The availability of the solution in the next week's Observer Digital Edition provides a convenient way for solvers to check their answers and learn from their mistakes. By attempting to solve the puzzle, individuals can enjoy a fun and intellectually stimulating activity that exercises their problem-solving skills and logic.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011118361726403236}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.2270030528306961}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.002512990264222026}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.024781323969364166}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.008299149572849274}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.0067192567512393}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012361239350866526}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.31154054403305054}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.0039595551788806915}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.11019902676343918}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.02659463882446289}, {"token": " solving", "logprob": -0.5781631469726562}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.03187396004796028}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.12209165841341019}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -4.970903682988137e-05}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -7.319182623177767e-05}, {"token": " outlined", "logprob": -1.7165961265563965}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -9.179073458653875e-06}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.06287086009979248}, {"token": 